request.description:
**Read-only.** Returns the consolidated clearance record — used to display the admission clearance page / form printout. All data comes from existing profile records; no manual fill required.

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "application_number": "PGS26...",
    "form_number": null,
    "session": "2025/2026",
    "biodata": {
      "name": "Doe John Michael",
      "maiden_name": "Not Applicable",
      "date_of_birth": "1990-05-15",
      "state_of_origin": "Oyo",
      "local_govt_area": "Ibadan North",
      "permanent_address": "45 University Road, Ibadan",
      "passport_url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/..."
    },
    "programme": {
      "faculty": "Faculty of Science",
      "department": "Computer Science",
      "degree": "M.Sc. Computer Science",
      "mode_of_study": "Full Time",
      "field_of_interest": 3
    },
    "sponsorship": [
      { "name": "Federal Government", "address": "Abuja" }
    ],
    "educational_records": [
      {
        "school": "University of Lagos",
        "from": "September/2010",
        "to": "June/2014",
        "degree": "B.Sc",
        "date_of_award": "November 2014",
        "course": "Computer Science",
        "class_obtained": "First Class"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Returns all data needed to render the financial clearance printout — student details, programme, fee schedule breakdown, school fee receipts for the current session, acceptance fee status, clearance status, and Deputy Registrar signatory.

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "generated_at": "2025-11-03 10:45:00",
    "session": "2025/2026",
    "student": {
      "numeration": "PGS26...",
      "matric_no": "12345",
      "name": "SURNAME Othername",
      "faculty": "Faculty of Science",
      "department": "Computer Science",
      "degree": "M.Sc",
      "mode": "Full Time"
    },
    "fee_schedule": {
      "currency": "Naira",
      "items": [
        { "id": 1, "description": "Tuition Fee", "amount": 250000 }
      ],
      "total": 400000
    },
    "school_fees": {
      "total_charged": 400000,
      "total_paid": 400000,
      "outstanding": 0,
      "receipts": []
    },
    "acceptance_fee": {
      "total_charged": 50000,
      "total_paid": 50000,
      "outstanding": 0
    },
    "clearance_status": "Cleared",
    "signatory": {
      "title": "Dr.",
      "name": "John Doe",
      "credentials": "PhD"
    }
  }
}
```

`clearance_status` values: `Cleared` | `Part Payment` | `Not Cleared`

Returns the current wallet balance and a UnibadanMFB deposit link.

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "balance": 150000,
    "currency": "NGN",
    "payment_link": "https://unibadanmfb.org/wallet.php?ref=PGS26...&pid=17"
  }
}
```

Wallet is auto-created if this is the student's first call.

Returns courses the student has registered for the current session, with a summary.

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "reg_id": 42,
      "course_id": 1,
      "course_code": "CSC701",
      "course_title": "Advanced Algorithms",
      "unit": 3,
      "type": "Required"
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "count": 5,
    "total_units": 15,
    "locked": false,
    "session": "2025/2026"
  }
}
```

Lightweight lock state + unit summary — no full course list.

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "locked": false,
    "count": 5,
    "total_units": 15,
    "session": "2025/2026"
  }
}
```

Locks the course registration. Once locked, courses cannot be added or removed without a registry unlock.

Automatically records the lock timestamp and the active Deputy Registrar's details (from `letter_officials`).

No request body needed.

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Course registration confirmed and locked.",
  "data": {
    "locked_at": "2025-11-02 10:30:00",
    "locked_date": "2025-11-02",
    "signatory": {
      "title": "Deputy Registrar",
      "name": "A. O. Olaoye",
      "credentials": null
    }
  }
}
```

**Response (422):** No courses registered yet.

Returns whether a passport photo exists and its full S3 URL.

